---
import DetailLayout from '../../layouts/DetailLayout.astro';
---

<DetailLayout
  title="Reinforcement Learning"
  eyebrow="NOW STUDYING · 02"
  description="从人类反馈到策略优化，慢慢理清语言模型的强化学习与后训练。"
>
  <section class="resource-feature green-feature">
    <div class="resource-index">BOOK 01</div>
    <div>
      <p class="resource-type">正在读</p>
      <h2>Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback</h2>
      <p class="resource-authors">Nathan Lambert · 2026</p>
      <p>一本围绕语言模型后训练的 RLHF 入门书，从指令微调、奖励模型讲到策略优化与评估。</p>
      <div class="resource-actions">
        <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.12501" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">arXiv 页面 ↗</a>
        <a href="/learning/rl/rlhf-nathan-lambert.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">PDF ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="resource-feature green-feature detail-section">
    <div class="resource-index">PAPER 01</div>
    <div>
      <p class="resource-type">当前在读</p>
      <h2>Score Centering Stabilizes Off-policy Reinforcement Learning</h2>
      <p class="resource-authors">Martin Marek, Max Ryabinin · 2026</p>
      <p>论文把大语言模型 RL 中的训练—推理不匹配拆解为持续累积的 score drift，并提出一个加性的 centering correction 来抵消这种漂移。</p>
      <div class="resource-actions">
        <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.20807v1" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">摘要 ↗</a>
        <a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2609.20807v1" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">PDF ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</DetailLayout>
